  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Database Access Platform \u2013 overview.** Scraped by `deploy/monitoring/prometheus.yml`. Metric families from `docs/operations.md` (Metrics catalogue):\ngateway `dbp_gateway_logical_sessions{datasource,application}`, `dbp_gateway_pinned_sessions`, `dbp_gateway_pool_{active,idle,waiting,total,max}{datasource,database}`, `dbp_gateway_statements_total{datasource,application,operation,success}`, `dbp_gateway_statement_duration_seconds`, `dbp_gateway_pool_acquire_seconds`, `dbp_gateway_errors_total{sqlState}`, `dbp_gateway_telemetry_dropped_total` \u00b7\nproxy `dbp_proxy_connections_active{listener,application,datasource,backend}`, `dbp_proxy_connections_opened_total`, `dbp_proxy_connections_refused_total{listener,reason}`, `dbp_proxy_telemetry_dropped_total` \u00b7\ncontrol plane `dbp_controlplane_telemetry_events_total{type}`, `dbp_controlplane_components_online`, `dbp_controlplane_violations_open{policyKind}`, `dbp_controlplane_collector_runs_total{database,what,outcome}` \u00b7 examples `hikaricp_connections_active{pool}`.\n\nExact names/labels are fixed by each module README and visible on `/metrics`; adjust a query here if a component differs. The gateway story is **logical vs physical**; the proxy story is **connections by application**."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Headline",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Gateway logical sessions",
      "description": "Driver connections open against the gateway (what applications think they have).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "dbp-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#3987e5"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "center"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "dbp-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(dbp_gateway_logical_sessions{datasource=~\"$datasource\",application=~\"$application\"})",
          "legendFormat": "logical",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
